"{{Term/Store|EX Treasure: Ancient Mask||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|EX Treasure: Ancient Mask}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Outpost Ruins}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref> It is exclusive to {{TMT}} [[Downloadable Content]] Pack.

==Overview==
This [[Side Quest]] is obtained upon leaving the [[Great Plateau]] and loading the overworld of [[Hyrule Kingdom]], which can be done by [[Warping]], reloading a save file, dying, or leaving an [[Ancient Shrine]]. When the Quest is activated, [[Link]] will be tasked with finding ''[[Misko's EX Journal]]'', which is rumored to be in the [[Outpost Ruins]].<ref>{{Cite|There's a journal that places the location of this treasure somewhere in the {{Color BotW|Red|Outpost Ruins}}...|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|It is possible to activate the second stage of this Side Quest by reading ''Misko's EX Journal'' without triggering any of the loading conditions for its activation.}}

In ''Misko's EX Journal'', there are clues to the locations of eight [[Treasure Chest]]s, each containing a priceless relic stolen from [[Hyrule Castle]] by [[Misko]].<ref>{{Cite|I hid the eight priceless relics I stole from Hyrule Castle in treasure chests... I shall write down their locations. -{{Color BotW|Blue|Misko}}|Misko's EX Journal|BotW}}</ref> The Journal states that the ancient mask is at the ruins where soldiers gathered and the waters of [[Lake Kolomo]] can be seen.<ref>{{Cite|The ancient mask lies {{Color BotW|Red|at the ruins where soldiers gathered}}. From there, {{Color BotW|Red|the waters of Lake Kolomo are visible}}.|Misko's EX Journal|BotW}}</ref>

The Treasure Chest can be found buried next to the southeastern corner of the largest building at the [[Kolomo Garrison Ruins]]. It can be pulled out of the ground using the [[Magnesis]] [[Rune]]. Once free, Link can open the Chest to receive [[Majora's Mask (Item)|Majora's Mask]], completing the Side Quest.<ref>{{Cite|You found the treasure that was hidden at Kolomo Garrison Ruins and obtained {{Color BotW|Red|Majora's Mask}}!|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

